    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the corridor of a student dormitory with a hundred-year history\u2026 and you find yourself sleeping in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken as a cat, your memories lost. Paws in place of hands, fur covering your face \u2014 the only thing you remember is that you were once a resident here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But fortunately, the one you\u2019ve transformed into is \u2018Bon\u2019, the dorm cat loved by everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stroll through the corridors, chat with the dorm residents, receive treats, run errands, and when you\u2019re tired, curl up for a nap under the kotatsu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run freely through a realistically recreated 2D map of this historic dorm \u2014 as a cat. Talk to the residents, help solve their problems, and pick up useful tidbits of information. Choose your what you say wisely \u2014 friendship can bring unexpected rewards...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every resident has their own personality and routine. Some can only be found at certain times and places. When you\u2019re tired of roaming, curl up and sleep until the right moment comes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While enjoying this carefree moratorium that only a cat can enjoy, search for the secrets hidden within the dorm and the memories you\u2019ve lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870060/extras/6184d0c81aff0751b589f8feb50a3f2b.avif?t=1752735068\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the corridor of a student dormitory with a hundred-year history\u2026 and you find yourself sleeping in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken as a cat, your memories lost. Paws in place of hands, fur covering your face \u2014 the only thing you remember is that you were once a resident here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But fortunately, the one you\u2019ve transformed into is \u2018Bon\u2019, the dorm cat loved by everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stroll through the corridors, chat with the dorm residents, receive treats, run errands, and when you\u2019re tired, curl up for a nap under the kotatsu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run freely through a realistically recreated 2D map of this historic dorm \u2014 as a cat. Talk to the residents, help solve their problems, and pick up useful tidbits of information. Choose your what you say wisely \u2014 friendship can bring unexpected rewards...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every resident has their own personality and routine. Some can only be found at certain times and places. When you\u2019re tired of roaming, curl up and sleep until the right moment comes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While enjoying this carefree moratorium that only a cat can enjoy, search for the secrets hidden within the dorm and the memories you\u2019ve lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870060/extras/6184d0c81aff0751b589f8feb50a3f2b.avif?t=1752735068\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "You wake up as Bon, the dorm\u2019s beloved cat \u2014 memories gone, paws in place. Roam a century-old student dorm, chat with residents, nap under the kotatsu, enjoy a cat life while uncovering lost secrets and your past. \u203bThis game is distributed with permission from the Yoshida Dormitory Student Council.",
